{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2543", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2543/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2543/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2543/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2543", "id": 2999845752, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s6yzgN4", "number": 2543, "title": "Uploading .plan to ArduPilot using import_qgroundcontrol_mission corrupts parameter", "user": {"login": "matthieu-db", "id": 170411151, "node_id": "U_kgDOCihEjw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170411151?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/matthieu-db", "html_url": "https://github.com/matthieu-db", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/matthieu-db/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/matthieu-db/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/matthieu-db/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/matthieu-db/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/matthieu-db/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/matthieu-db/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/matthieu-db/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/matthieu-db/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/matthieu-db/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 629977267, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw2Mjk5NzcyNjc=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/labels/bug", "name": "bug", "color": "ee0701", "default": true, "description": null}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 4, "created_at": "2025-04-16T14:30:16Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-15T11:07:39Z", "closed_at": "2025-05-06T20:53:22Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "For the DIGICAM_CONTROL message, when uploading the .plan (attached as a .json) parameter 5 comes back when downloaded as 1.28e-5 instead of 1. The drone also doesn't take a picture (which it should because I am setting it to 1)\n\nWhat could cause this? Is there a workaround?\n\n[before upload to drone: testpretty.json](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19778691/testpretty.json)\n\n[after being downloaded from the drone: testdownloaded.json](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19778742/testdownloaded.json)\n\nScript I used to upload to the drone:\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nfrom mavsdk import System\nimport mavsdk.mission_raw\n\n\nasync def run():\n    drone = System()\n    await drone.connect(system_address=\"udp://0.0.0.0:14555\")\n\n    print(\"Waiting for drone to connect...\")\n    async for state in drone.core.connection_state():\n        if state.is_connected:\n            print(f\"-- Connected to drone!\")\n            break\n\n    out = await drone.mission_raw.import_qgroundcontrol_mission(\n        \"testpretty.plan\")\n\n    print(f\"{len(out.mission_items)} mission items and \"\n          f\"{len(out.rally_items)} rally items imported.\")\n\n    await drone.mission_raw.upload_mission(out.mission_items)\n\n    print(\"Mission uploaded\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    # Run the asyncio loop\n    asyncio.run(run())\n```", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "follower